mn with id=\"root\" containing the WarningCard and ActionButton children."},{"id":"msg_005ca4751001ycvlJwUqQCC6c0","role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_00_SvhgcIjzFLDHW7ljZhNh4013","type":"function","function":{"name":"render_a2ui","arguments":"{\"components\":[{\"component\":\"Column\",\"id\":\"root\",\"children\":[\"warn\",\"next\"]},{\"component\":\"WarningCard\",\"id\":\"warn\",\"title\":\"删除确认\",\"text\":\"即将归档删除文件 region-sales-2026-08-result.csv，删除后不可恢复。请确认继续。\"},{\"component\":\"ActionButton\",\"id\":\"next\",\"label\":\"下一步\",\"action\":{\"event\":{\"name\":\"wizard_next\",\"context\":{\"step\":1,\"file\":\"region-sales-2026-08-result.csv\"}}}}],\"surfaceId\":\"p6-wizard\"}"}}]},{"id":"toolres-call_00_SvhgcIjzFLDHW7ljZhNh4013","role":"tool","toolCallId":"call_00_SvhgcIjzFLDHW7ljZhNh4013","content":"UI surface \"p6-wizard\" rendered (3 components). The user can already see it; do NOT paste the JSON back into chat."},{"id":"msg_005ca551b001iMgjUc5k6XbvBw","role":"assistant","content":"已渲染向导第一步（p6-wizard）：WarningCard 提示删除该文件，配\"下一步\"按钮（事件 wizard_next，step=1）。"}]}

